---
import ContentLayout from '@layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@config/site';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`Important information about the limitations of the calculators and content on ${SITE.name}.`}
  path="/disclaimer"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  updated="2026-07-17"
>
  <p>
    The calculators and information provided on {SITE.name} are for general educational
    and informational purposes only. While we strive for accuracy and test our formulas
    carefully, we make no warranty as to the completeness, reliability or accuracy of
    any result.
  </p>

  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site constitutes financial, investment, medical, health, legal, tax
    or other professional advice. Our calculators cannot account for your full personal
    circumstances. Before making any decision based on a result, consult a qualified
    professional who can advise on your specific situation.
  </p>

  <h2>Results are estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Calculator outputs are estimates based solely on the values you enter and the
    assumptions built into each tool. Real-world figures — such as loan offers, tax
    liabilities or health assessments — may differ due to factors outside the tool's
    scope, including rates, fees, regulations and individual variation.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Our site may link to third-party websites for reference. We are not responsible for
    the content or accuracy of any external site.
  </p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    Any reliance you place on a calculator's result is strictly at your own risk.
    {SITE.name} accepts no liability for loss or damage arising from use of the site.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
